# Runbook — {{tramat.project_name}}

Operational knowledge lives here, not in YAML comments. When an incident is
resolved, append an entry; when a config value exists *because* of an
incident, link the entry next to it.

## Incident log

Newest first. One entry per incident:

```
### YYYY-MM-DD — <one-line symptom>
- **Impact**: what broke, which tables/jobs, silent or loud
- **Cause**: root cause once known
- **Fix**: what change resolved it (link the PR)
- **Follow-up**: guard added so it can't recur silently (QA check, contract, alert) — or why none
```

